[0.010, "o", "\r\n==============================================================================\r\nQ: Did our signups fall from last month?\r\n==============================================================================\r\n\r\nConfidence: low\r\nTook 72s over 8 steps, 26,292 tokens, 21 observations gathered, 10 cited\r\n\r\nANSWER\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  Cannot be determined: the available data sources have no signup, session, or contact records for August 12, 2026 onward, so there is no data covering last month (August) or this month (September) to compare.  [posthog.list_events 4c4d0061, posthog.event_trend 409cd467, ga4.compare_periods dced629b, ga4.get_sessions 5afad11a]\r\n  The most recent period with actual signup data, late July through August 12, 2026, shows a flat daily rate of roughly 150-165 signups with no decline.  [posthog.event_trend 66fdf2f1]\r\n\r\nFINDINGS\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  Signup event data ends Augu"]
[0.000, "o", "st 12, 2026  (medium)\r\n    - The 'user signed up' event in PostHog was last seen on 2026-08-12T20:54:00Z, and no signup records exist for any date after that.  [posthog.list_events 4c4d0061, posthog.event_trend 409cd467]\r\n    - Daily signup counts from late July through August 12 were stable, ranging roughly 150-165 per day with no visible trend up or down.  [posthog.event_trend 66fdf2f1]\r\n  GA4 and HubSpot also have no coverage for the period in question  (medium)\r\n    - GA4 session data likewise ends at 2026-08-12, and GA4 queries scoped to August or September 2026 returned no rows, so GA4 cannot corroborate or refute a September change either.  [ga4.get_sessions 8c35ea31, ga4.compare_periods dced629b, ga4.compare_periods d89ce18b, ga4.get_sessions 5afad11a]\r\n    - HubSpot contact records for August and September 2026 also returned no rows.  [hubspot.contacts c3a123b1, hubspot.contacts fe8bddc2]\r\n\r\nCHARTS\r\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  user signed up over "]
